# INVWINSA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the text
# search.  Find text opens the search dialog on the text; Alt and a label's
# letter moves the focus to the status list and to the location, and
# back to the text; OK with no value is refused under the fields, the
# focus on the text.  A maker's name
# finds its item, whose form ENTER shows and OK closes, back on the
# results; ESC opens the dialog again with the text kept, and a text no
# item holds finds nothing.  A text given with a serial number is the
# search, the serial number left out.  ESC goes back to the dialog,
# whose Cancel, asking nothing after a change, opens the item list; the
# end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSA.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-S T
S DIALOG
K ALT-A
S ALTA
K ALT-L
S ALTL
K ALT-T
K ENTER
S EMPTY
T Hercules
K ENTER
S FOUND
K ENTER
S ITEM
K ENTER
S BACK
K ESC
S AGAIN
T Zenith
K ENTER
S NONE
K ESC
T IBM
K TAB
T HGC-0042
K ENTER
S BOTH
K ESC
T Tandon
K ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-F X
